OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,FAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,8,Fstripped of his Freedom of the City of
OL,9,FLondon, losing one of his final
OL,10,Fhonours.
OL,12,FThe King's brother was stripped of his
OL,13,Froyal titles and honours in 2025 by
OL,14,FCharles, because of his connection to
OL,15,Fthe late paedophile financier Jeffrey
OL,16,FEpstein.
OL,18,FHe still currently retains the Freedom
OL,19,Fof the City of London, an award he
OL,20,Freceived in 2021 because his father
OL,21,FPrince Phillip had been a freeman.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/9
