FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,FThe City of London Corporation, the
OL,8,Fbody which administers the ancient
OL,9,Fcity centre, is now drawing up plans
OL,10,Fto strip him of that Freedom.
OL,12,FIn May, it criticised Andrew for
OL,13,Ffailing to surrender his Freedom of
OL,14,Fthe City of London "despite being
OL,15,Fasked to do so".
OL,17,FNow it has emerged that the
OL,18,FCorporation is developing a process to
OL,19,Fremove Andrew's right to Freedom of
OL,20,Fthe City, as it said there is no
OL,21,Fcurrent mechanism allowing it to do so.
OL,26,@vD@TOUwD@OO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,FA City of London Corporation
OL,8,Fspokesperson said:
OL,10,F"Our thoughts remain with the victims
OL,11,Fand survivors of Jeffrey Epstein, and
OL,12,Fwith all victims and survivors of
OL,13,Fsexual abuse and exploitation.
OL,15,F"We are developing a process that
OL,16,Fwould allow the Freedom of the City of
OL,17,FLondon to be removed where
OL,18,Fappropriate, having determined that
OL,19,Fthere is currently no effective lawful
OL,20,Fmechanism to do so.
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,F"If elected Members approve the new
OL,8,Fprocess, they will then consider
OL,9,Fwhether Andrew Mountbatten-Windsor's
OL,10,FFreedom should be removed."
OL,12,FThere has been some discussion that
OL,13,Fthe Corporation could draft a Bill,
OL,14,Fwhich Parliament would have to pass,
OL,15,Fallowing it to strip Andrew of the
OL,16,Fhonour.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@[O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,FBut the spokesperson suggested that
OL,8,Fthe Corporation would rather move at a
OL,9,Fquicker pace, carrying out its own
OL,10,Fprocess to allow the move. The
OL,11,Fspokesperson said:
OL,13,F"We understand why people want this
OL,14,Fmatter resolved as quickly as
OL,15,Fpossible, and we share that desire.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,F"The fastest and most appropriate
OL,8,Fapproach is to put in place a lawful
OL,9,Fprocess that allows the City
OL,10,FCorporation to make these decisions
OL,11,Fitself, rather than seeking
OL,12,Flegislation through Parliament.
OL,14,F"We are progressing that work and, if
OL,15,Felected Members approve the new
OL,16,Fprocess, they will then be able to
OL,17,Fconsider whether Andrew Mountbatten-
OL,18,FWindsor's Freedom should be removed."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOUzD@eO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/9
