CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,FIn a motion of censure passed in May,
OL,8,Fthe City Corporation's Court of Common
OL,9,FCouncil said there was "profound
OL,10,Fdisappointment" Andrew has "not
OL,11,Fsurrendered his Freedom despite being
OL,12,Fasked to do so".
OL,14,FThe City Corporation's highest
OL,15,Fdecision-making body said it lacks the
OL,16,Fpower to remove Andrew's Freedom as
OL,17,F"his Freedom is not an honour or
OL,18,Foffice but a property right protected
OL,19,Funder both domestic law and the
OL,20,FEuropean Convention on Human Rights".
OL,26,@qD@XOUrD@OO]rD@\OUtD@OO]yD@AOU|D@dO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/9
