OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785494890
OL,3,CAndrew Mountbatten-Windsor could be
OL,4,Cstripped of Freedom of the City of
OL,5,CLondon
OL,7,FOne of the City of London's ancient
OL,8,Ftraditions, the Freedom is believed to
OL,9,Fhave begun in 1237 and enabled
OL,10,Frecipients to carry out their trade.
OL,12,FAs well as being nominated for, or
OL,13,Fapplying for, the Freedom, it is also
OL,14,Finherited via patrimony or offered by
OL,15,Fthe City Corporation to individuals as
OL,16,Fa way of paying tribute to their
OL,17,Fcontribution to London or public life,
OL,18,For to celebrate a very significant
OL,19,Fachievement.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/9
